## CloudNoise Chain

`/Prismatiscape/Demo/ExampleMaterials/Textures/Prismatiscape_CloudNoise` has many plugin demo material referencers, but the runtime-relevant chain for the clean/segment/character verification maps is:

```text
/Prismatiscape/Prismatiscape_Manager_BP
-> /Prismatiscape/Prismatiscape_NiagaraGridDrawer
-> /Prismatiscape/Demo/ExampleMaterials/Textures/Prismatiscape_CloudNoise
```

AssetRegistry dependency evidence:

| Asset | Relevant dependencies |
| --- | --- |
| `/Prismatiscape/Prismatiscape_Manager_BP` | `/Prismatiscape/Prismatiscape_NiagaraGridDrawer`, render targets, simulation profiles |
| `/Prismatiscape/Prismatiscape_NiagaraGridDrawer` | `/Prismatiscape/Demo/ExampleMaterials/Textures/Prismatiscape_CloudNoise`, render targets, Niagara modules |

Manager spawn path:

```text
UPrismatiscapeSettings::UPrismatiscapeSettings()
  -> PrismatiscapeManagerClass = /Prismatiscape/Prismatiscape_Manager_BP_C
UPrismatiscapeWorldSubsystem::OnWorldBeginPlay()
  -> SpawnManager()
```

## Yeeto Chain

`YeetoMosquito` is not a dependency of the clean project materials. Known project-side referencers are:

```text
/Game/PrismatiscapeStudy/Materials/M_PrisStudy_GrassWPO_Project
/Game/PrismatiscapeStudy/Materials/M_PrisStudy_BushWPO_Project
```

Those two materials are kept as learning copies, not production candidates.

Character deform staged builds also include:

```text
/Prismatiscape/Demo/ExampleCharacter/Example_CharacterMaterial
-> /Prismatiscape/Demo/ExampleMaterials/Textures/YeetoMosquito
```

This is expected for the current `CharacterDeform` pass because the BP child intentionally overrides its skeletal mesh with the plugin demo character. The native parent no longer hard-loads that mesh, so clean and segment maps do not inherit this dependency through the C++ class CDO.

## Hard-load Removal Result

`APrismatiscapeStudyCharacterDeformProxy` now creates only the `USkeletalMeshComponent` and `UPrismatiscapeDeformComponentCharacter`. Its native CDO has no default skeletal mesh. The sample mesh is stored on:

```text
/Game/PrismatiscapeStudy/BP/BP_PrisStudy_CharacterDeformProxy
```

Latest staged manifest checks:

| Target map | ExampleCharacter | YeetoMosquito | CloudNoise | Plugin Demo entries | Smoke |
| --- | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | --- |
| `M_PrisStudy_CleanMaterialVerification` | `0` | `0` | `3` | `3` | exit `0` |
| `M_PrisStudy_SegmentDeformVerification` | `0` | `0` | `3` | `3` | exit `0` |
| `M_PrisStudy_CharacterDeformVerification` | `8` | `2` | `3` | `13` | exit `0` |

## Script Update

`scripts/cook_prismatiscape_clean_map.ps1` now reports these stage manifest buckets separately:

| Bucket | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| `Prismatiscape Manager BP` | plugin manager BP entry count |
| `Prismatiscape NiagaraGridDrawer` | Niagara system entry count |
| `Prismatiscape SimulationProfiles` | simulation/style profile entries |
| `Prismatiscape DefaultStyleProfiles` | default style profile entries |
| `Prismatiscape ExampleCharacter` | demo character mesh/material entries |
| `Prismatiscape ExampleMaterials` | demo example material entries |
| `Prismatiscape ExampleMaterial textures` | demo texture entries |
| `Prismatiscape CloudNoise` | exact CloudNoise file count |
| `Prismatiscape YeetoMosquito` | exact Yeeto file count |

## Next Safe Cut

이에타 판단:

1. plugin content mutation은 보류한다.
2. project-owned Manager/Niagara replacement는 큰 작업이다. Manager BP의 `PostTick`, `SetInitialParams`, RT location calculation, Niagara array bindings, MPC updates를 모두 대체해야 한다.
3. 최소 안전 패스는 완료됐다. clean/segment map은 `ExampleCharacter=0`, `YeetoMosquito=0`으로 내려갔고, character map만 학습용 demo character dependency를 유지한다. 다음 큰 변경은 Manager/Niagara 대체 범위를 separate implementation plan으로 확정하는 것이다.
4. config override와 `/Prismatiscape/Demo` NeverCook 실험은 `Docs/Analysis/Prismatiscape_ManagerReplacementGate.md`에 따로 기록했다. native Manager 단독은 RT가 모두 `0`이고, `/Prismatiscape/Demo` NeverCook는 `Prismatiscape_NiagaraGridDrawer -> Prismatiscape_CloudNoise` 참조 때문에 cook error가 난다.

티브렛 판단:

1. C++ component/BP 학습 루트는 이미 안정화됐다.
2. demo texture 제거는 component/BP 문제가 아니라 Manager/Niagara asset 문제다.
3. runtime packaging gate에서는 `DemoMap=0`, `_MCP_Temp=0`, clean project material direct demo dependency `0`을 계속 기준으로 삼고, `CloudNoise`는 Manager replacement 전까지 known dependency로 기록한다.
